user restaurant-console
topic write restaurant/v1/table/+/order/requested
topic read restaurant/v1/table/+/order/status-changed
topic read restaurant/v1/table/+/snapshot
topic read restaurant/v1/kitchen/pressure

user restaurant-backend
topic read restaurant/v1/table/+/order/requested
topic write restaurant/v1/table/+/order/status-changed
topic write restaurant/v1/table/+/snapshot
topic write restaurant/v1/kitchen/pressure
topic read $SYS/broker/version

